BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:external-review@2027-04-03@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270403
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270429
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[You] Snapshot: Independent review of the Q1 2027 provisional repor
 t
DESCRIPTION:About 8-12 hours. Read the provisional Q1 2027 report against t
 he registered plan and the deviations log\; check that each headline figur
 e is computed as the plan defines it (read the code\, or recompute a few n
 umbers from the data bundle)\; look at the sample of hand decisions and th
 eir written rules. Send a short written review (two to five pages: what ho
 lds up\, what doesn't\, what you'd change) by 28 April. The window can mov
 e a week or two if needed\; publication is 1 May.\n\nOwner: External revie
 wer. Source: docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
